  "rpi4": "<p>The Raspberry Pi 4 runs Linux in 64-bit mode (AArch64), so the privilege levels here are the exception levels we used: your programs at EL0, the kernel at EL1. ARM defines EL2 for hypervisors and EL3 for the secure firmware layer. A 32-bit ARM core has the same idea under different names (user mode and supervisor mode).</p>\n<p>The concepts transfer to any ARM Cortex-A board running Linux.</p>",
